<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/17/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/name> "Section 27 of the principal Act is amended by inserting,"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/17/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/17/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "immediately after the words \"appear himself personally\" in paragraph (c) of subsection (1), the words \"or where he is a member of a trade union of workmen, be represented by an officer or employee of the trade union\"."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/17/eng@> .
